{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gothic Hell: Survivors</strong> throws you into fast-paced gothic chaos where survival is earned through spellcraft, reflexes, and smart build choices. Fight through short, intense runs filled with relentless swarms, evolving magic, and rich upgrades that shape each attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Our Formula:</strong>\u00a0VS + POE / D2 = GHS</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CHOOSE A SURVIVOR</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/line.png?t=1749177192\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/SelectCharacters2.gif?t=1749177192\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Build your power, and dive into an atmospheric bullet hell experience that rewards creativity, adaptability, and momentum. No two runs play the same, and each one brings you closer to mastering the madness.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LEARN POWERFUL SPELLS<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/line.png?t=1749177192\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/ActionOnBridge.gif?t=1749177192\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Master auto-cast spells and reactive movement while unlocking new powers, characters, and passive boosts. Explore layered 3D arenas with vertical challenges, hidden secrets, and dynamic events that make every battle feel fresh and alive.</i><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/line.png?t=1749177192\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/ActionOnBridge2.gif?t=1749177192\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KILL BIG BOSS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/line.png?t=1749177192\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/KillDragon.gif?t=1749177192\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>...or DIE.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced bullet hell ARPG with auto-cast spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Loot? A lot!</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Meta Progress? Yes!</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Unique survivors with game-changing abilities</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vertical 3D arenas packed with secrets and shifting layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep synergy systems and meta progression between runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedural encounters blended with handcrafted visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed for high replayability and quick-hit sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gothic horror world with stylized art and haunting sound</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3727710?t=1749177192","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/8a5f66c007ebea9726951a4ef06d82b6748a27d5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749177192","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/aaec7073153c34170fedfb70c50ea694e8151a87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749177192","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/aaec7073153c34170fedfb70c50ea694e8151a87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749177192","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18